== probe 2: root Info.plist added; nib varints drafted as standard LEB128 ==
$ rea decode-interface-builder probe1/Sample.app --format json -> exit 0 (envelope ok), stderr 0 bytes
  coverage: archive_decode partial, reason one_or_more_archives_invalid
  limitation: Some Interface Builder archives could not be decoded: Base.lproj/MainMenu.nib: NIBArchive variable integer is too long
  "NIBArchive variable integer is too long" - the parser readVarint returns on byte & 0x80:
  the FINAL 7-bit group carries the HIGH bit SET (terminator), earlier groups CLEAR -
  the inverse of standard LEB128; the draft standard-LEB128 encoding never terminated

