== parser-source reads grounding the fixture (installed rea-agents 6.8.0, own-work environment) ==
  dist/artifacts/apple/NibArchive.js        - 50-byte header (magic NIBArchive, u32LE formatVersion==1, coderVersion, 4x count/offset pairs in objects<keys<values<classes order, offsets in [50,len]); object rec = 3 varints (classIndex, valueStart, valueCount) with classIndex<classCount, valueStart+count<=valueCount; key rec = varint len + utf8; value rec = varint keyIndex + 1 type byte + payload (types 0-10); class rec = varint nameLen, varint extraCount(<=16), extraCount*4 bytes, utf8 name
  dist/domain/apple/appleArchiveFormat.js   - NIB_ARCHIVE_MAGIC = 4e 49 42 41 72 63 68 69 76 65 ("NIBArchive")
  dist/application/AppBundleExecutable.js   - BUNDLE_LAYOUTS: [Contents/Info.plist + Contents/MacOS] or [Info.plist at root]; findAppBundleResourceRoot requires one
  dist/artifacts/apple/InterfaceBuilderAnalysis.js - isInterfaceBuilderArchive = *.nib; document record fields (relative_path, archive_sha256, document_kind, object_count, connection_count, hierarchy_complete)
  dist/cli-runtime/interfaceBuilderGraph-*.js - classifyConnection: /outlet/->outlet, /action|eventconnection/->action, /segue/->segue, else other; UIRuntime*Connection vs NS*Connector field namespaces (NSSource/NSDestination/NSLabel)

All probes scratch-only; no repo byte written. The committed fixture bytes equal probe 4's build (same generator).
